  "body": "Fix [#331](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/331)\n\nAs per http://caniuse.com/#search=seamless , it doesn't seem to be supported.\nHence it is a good candidate for removal.\n\nCommits related to &lt;iframe seamless&gt;:\n[dfa3f22b5](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/dfa3f22b5278113cba689c3cf6e358f17e334311)\n[8edfe6da5](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/8edfe6da5a635f1c31f3ea22f2d323adc33b938e)\n[9e4f0956b](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/9e4f0956b3b2605f3cb25d5c77c63f8ef827a617)\n[b0b5d7b16](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/b0b5d7b1689440533f696b6cf62fd0ac43d07e2e)\n[b3bf8adba](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/b3bf8adbac93f4db6a63f432254dd39ea7e195e0)\n[e5a041ecd](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/e5a041ecdf7fa8ba95bf88b31bee46b9ef60fddc)\n[cc33290d6](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/cc33290d68d2d3e2dc66760c6dc3df3e68007c5d)\n[c4d639680](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/c4d639680480bd0835b2a1b2e5c607c482575984)\n",
